# NestJS Response Generation Pattern

Use this as the canonical pattern when creating or updating `response/*.response.ts`. Do not inspect any files except entity in the same module.

## Source of truth

- Read fields only from `src/modules/<module>/entities/*.entity.ts` in the same module.
- Include scalar entity columns in `<Module>Response`.
- Exclude collection relations (`OneToMany` arrays) from base response by default.
- Include single-object relations (`ManyToOne`/self relation) as optional nested response fields when present.

## Required file shape

- Import `PaginationResponse`, `StatusResponse`, `ApiProperty`.
- Export exactly these classes:
  - `<Module>Response`
  - `Array<Module>Response extends PaginationResponse` with `data?: <Module>Response[]`
  - `Status<Module>Response extends StatusResponse` with `data?: <Module>Response`
  - `StatusArray<Module>Response extends StatusResponse` with `data?: <Module>Response[]`
- Use `@ApiProperty()` for required fields and `@ApiProperty({ required: false })` for optional fields.
- Use `@ApiProperty({isArray:true, type: () => Type})` if field is array.

## Golden example (order-category)

```typescript
import { PaginationResponse } from 'nestjs-typeorm-shared'
import { StatusResponse } from 'nestjs-typeorm-shared'
import { ApiProperty } from '@nestjs/swagger'
import { BaseEntityResponse } from 'nestjs-typeorm-shared'

export class OrderCategoryResponse extends BaseEntityResponse {
  @ApiProperty()
  category_id: number

  @ApiProperty()
  category_name: string

  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  parent_category_id?: number

  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  parent_category?: OrderCategoryResponse

  @ApiProperty()
  order_type_prefix: string

  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  is_report_excluded?: boolean
}

export class ArrayOrderCategoryResponse extends PaginationResponse {
  @ApiProperty({ required: false, isArray: true, type: OrderCategoryResponse })
  data?: OrderCategoryResponse[]
}

export class StatusOrderCategoryResponse extends StatusResponse {
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  data?: OrderCategoryResponse
}

export class StatusArrayOrderCategoryResponse extends StatusResponse {
  @ApiProperty({ required: false, isArray: true, type: OrderCategoryResponse })
  data?: OrderCategoryResponse[]
}
```
